pdfcube (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Port the application to GTK 4 and GtkGLArea.
  * Replace fixed-function OpenGL with a shader-based renderer.
  * Add Meson, automated CLI/rendering tests, and modern desktop metadata.
  * Remove the obsolete Autotools and GtkGLExt implementation.
  * Refresh documentation, release metadata, and packaging validation.
  * Support desktop OpenGL and OpenGL ES 3 contexts selected by GTK.
  * Add Linux, Windows, and macOS build coverage.

 -- Mirko Maischberger <mirko.maischberger@gmail.com>  Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200

